{"parse":{"title":"Narcissus Wakes, Her Eyes Upon the Dawn","pageid":467745,"revid":2145390,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Narcissus Wakes, Her Eyes Upon the Dawn</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/8e/Constellation_Narcissus_Wakes%2C_Her_Eyes_Upon_the_Dawn.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122500\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation Narcissus Wakes, Her Eyes Upon the Dawn\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/8e/Constellation_Narcissus_Wakes%2C_Her_Eyes_Upon_the_Dawn.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122500\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/8e/Constellation_Narcissus_Wakes%2C_Her_Eyes_Upon_the_Dawn.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122500 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/8e/Constellation_Narcissus_Wakes%2C_Her_Eyes_Upon_the_Dawn.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122500 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation Narcissus Wakes, Her Eyes Upon the Dawn\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Narcissus_Wakes%2C_Her_Eyes_Upon_the_Dawn.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Narcissus Wakes, Her Eyes Upon the Dawn.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sandrone\" title=\"Sandrone\">Sandrone</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Of_All_Beside,_She_Takes_No_Part\" title=\"Of All Beside, She Takes No Part\">Of All Beside, She Takes No Part</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">-</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When Fagio fires a condensed beam for the third time while in <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Decoding</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Decoding</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Fagio will switch to this mode when using a Charged Attack.<br />When in this mode, Fagio will engage any opponents ahead with a sweeping fire attack, as well as fire condensed beams at intervals, dealing <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b>AoE Cryo DMG</b></span>.<br /><b>Radiance: Stellar Glimmer</b>: The condensed beams will instead deal <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b>AoE Cryo DMG</b></span> that is considered Stellar-Conduct DMG.</span></span></span> mode, the beam becomes a more powerful Condensed Cluster Beam that fires continuously. This beam will deal up to 4 additional instances of <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b>AoE Cryo DMG</b></span> at 100% of Sandrone's <a href=\"/wiki/ATK\" title=\"ATK\">ATK</a> on top of any subsequent original beam fired.<br /><b>Radiance: Stellar Glimmer</b>: The Condensed Cluster Beam will instead deal 4 additional instances of <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b>AoE Cryo DMG</b></span>. The DMG dealt with this attack, which is considered the corresponding Stellar Glimmer reaction DMG, is equal to:<br /><b>Radiance: Stellar-Conduct</b>: 80% of Sandrone's ATK.<br /><b>Radiance: Stellar Swirl</b>: 120% of Sandrone's ATK.<br />Additionally, all Stellar Glimmer reaction DMG dealt by Sandrone is <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">elevated</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Elevation</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Special DMG Boost effect. It is calculated independently of other DMG Boost effects.</span></span></span> by 20%.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"scale_att1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Scaling</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/ATK\" title=\"ATK\">ATK</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DMG Elevation\">DMG Elevation</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar-Conduct_DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stellar-Conduct DMG Elevation\">Stellar-Conduct DMG Elevation</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Swirl_DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stellar Swirl DMG Elevation\">Stellar Swirl DMG Elevation</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Narcissus Wakes, Her Eyes Upon the Dawn</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Sandrone\" title=\"Sandrone\">Sandrone</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_6_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 6 Constellation\">Level 6 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Advanced_Properties\">Advanced Properties</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNarcissus_Wakes%2C_Her_Eyes_Upon_the_Dawn%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable thc tdl\" style=\"min-width:600px\">\n<tbody><tr><th rowspan=\"2\"></th><th rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Gauge_Theory\" title=\"Elemental Gauge Theory\">Gauge<br />Units</a></th><th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Internal_Cooldown\" title=\"Internal Cooldown\">Internal Cooldown</a></th><th rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Interruption_Resistance\" title=\"Interruption Resistance\">Poise<br />Damage</a></th><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/Interruption_Resistance/Stagger\" title=\"Interruption Resistance/Stagger\">Stagger Effect</a></th><th rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blunt_Attack\" title=\"Blunt Attack\">Blunt</a></th></tr><tr><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Tag\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Tag</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Attacks with the same ICD Tag and the same ICD Type will share ICD.</span></span>&#8205;</th><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Type\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Type</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Attacks with the same ICD Tag and the same ICD Type will share ICD.</span></span>&#8205;</th><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"S. L.\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">S. L.</