rcisse s'<span lang=\"fr\">é</span>veille, les yeux riv<span lang=\"fr\">é</span>s sur l'aurore</td><td>Narcissus Wakes, Eyes Fixed Upon the Dawn</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Нарцисс</span> <span lang=\"ru\">пробуждается</span>, <span lang=\"ru\">взирая</span> <span lang=\"ru\">на</span> <span lang=\"ru\">рассвет</span><br /><small><i>Nartsiss probuzhdayetsya, vziraya na rassvet</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Narcissus Wakes, Her Eyes Upon the Dawn</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Thủy Tiên Tỉnh Mộng, Mong Đợi Bình Minh</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Die Narzisse erwacht, begr<span lang=\"de\">üß</span>t das Morgenlicht</td><td>The Narcissus Awakens, Greeting the Morning Light</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Narcissus Wakes, Her Eyes Upon the Dawn</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Narciso Desperto, Seus Olhos na Alvorada</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Nergis Uyan<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>yor, G<span lang=\"tr\">ö</span>zleri <span lang=\"tr\">Ş</span>afakta</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Narcissus si desta, i suoi occhi sull'alba</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNarcissus_Wakes%2C_Her_Eyes_Upon_the_Dawn%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:hre